{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 71,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.17418670654297,
        107.44088745117188,
        83.2621841430664
      ],
      "text": "Equity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.96521759033203,
        526.7279663085938,
        107.11021423339844
      ],
      "text": "Concurrent specimen testing was not practiced in the interview study countries. However,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        109.46521759033203,
        527.1119995117188,
        122.61021423339844
      ],
      "text": "it was believed to improve access to care by minimizing repeat visits and loss to follow-up.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        124.96521759033203,
        527.19384765625,
        138.11021423339844
      ],
      "text": "According to the interview study respondents, using non-sputum specimens has the potential",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.996599197387695,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        140.4652099609375,
        527.124267578125,
        153.61021423339844
      ],
      "text": "to improve access to care, especially with a test that can be performed at all levels of the health",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.98293685913086,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.9652099609375,
        526.9634399414062,
        169.11021423339844
      ],
      "text": "care system. Challenges with producing a sufficient quality and quantity of sputum are well",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        171.4652099609375,
        358.918701171875,
        184.61021423339844
      ],
      "text": "documented and can lead to repeat testing or false results.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        196.41680908203125,
        145.14486694335938,
        210.5048065185547
      ],
      "text": "Acceptability",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.20782470703125,
        526.7940063476562,
        234.3528289794922
      ],
      "text": "Based on the results of the interview study, LF-LAM is being used inconsistently for people",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        236.70782470703125,
        527.0031127929688,
        249.8528289794922
      ],
      "text": "living with HIV and only for very ill patients who cannot produce sputum. Our results are in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        252.20782470703125,
        308.7190856933594,
        265.35284423828125
      ],
      "text": "accordance with published literature on LF-LAM.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        276.21173095703125,
        527.0250854492188,
        289.35675048828125
      ],
      "text": "Prior research on user perspectives on LF-LAM showed that it is generally described as",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        291.71173095703125,
        526.9920654296875,
        304.85675048828125
      ],
      "text": "acceptable by key stakeholders, due to its fast turnaround time, ease of use (lack of technical",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        307.21173095703125,
        526.9589233398438,
        320.35675048828125
      ],
      "text": "expertise required), low or no maintenance and equipment required, and urine being more",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        322.7117004394531,
        526.9677734375,
        335.8567199707031
      ],
      "text": "accessible and less stigmatized than sputum. LF-LAM is deemed particularly acceptable when",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        338.2117004394531,
        527.0172729492188,
        351.3567199707031
      ],
      "text": "used in combination with other tests and clinical considerations. As the sensitivity of LF-LAM is",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.995698928833008,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.7117004394531,
        527.008544921875,
        366.8567199707031
      ],
      "text": "especially low where the pretest probability is low, participants commented that it should not",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        369.2117004394531,
        526.9700317382812,
        382.3567199707031
      ],
      "text": "be used as a standalone test but should instead be used in combination with other tests, and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        384.7117004394531,
        526.9591064453125,
        397.8567199707031
      ],
      "text": "that the results should be interpreted by a doctor considering the full clinical context, rather",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        400.2117004394531,
        240.0990753173828,
        413.3567199707031
      ],
      "text": "than being considered in isolation.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        425.163330078125,
        128.31727600097656,
        439.2513122558594
      ],
      "text": "Feasibility",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        448.4542236328125,
        526.96337890625,
        461.5992431640625
      ],
      "text": "Interview study findings highlighted that the benefits of LF-LAM are crucially dependent on",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        462.4542236328125,
        306.9886779785156,
        475.5992431640625
      ],
      "text": "how several feasibility challenges are addressed.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        482.2062072753906,
        78.81909942626953,
        495.3512268066406
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        482.2062072753906,
        526.9312133789062,
        495.3512268066406
      ],
      "text": "Hygienic, safe and private sanitary facilities with running water are necessary for LF-LAM",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        497.7062072753906,
        526.5584716796875,
        510.8512268066406
      ],
      "text": "implementation at a testing site, but they are not always available, particularly in rural areas.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.971964836120605,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        513.2061767578125,
        366.31646728515625,
        526.3511962890625
      ],
      "text": "Investments in staffing and sanitary facilities are required.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        528.7061767578125,
        78.81920623779297,
        541.8511962890625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        528.7061767578125,
        526.6387329101562,
        541.8511962890625
      ],
      "text": "Not everybody can spontaneously produce or collect urine samples. This can be the case, for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.978879928588867,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        544.2061767578125,
        527.019287109375,
        557.3511962890625
      ],
      "text": "example, when the patient is too ill or septic or has to be catheterized because collecting",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        559.7061767578125,
        527.0247192382812,
        572.8511962890625
      ],
      "text": "urine samples from diapers is impossible, or if the hospital has no clean, private space to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        575.2061767578125,
        156.76968383789062,
        588.3511962890625
      ],
      "text": "produce urine.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        590.7061767578125,
        78.81920623779297,
        603.8511962890625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        590.7061767578125,
        527.2974853515625,
        603.8511962890625
      ],
      "text": "Visibility of faint results and result interpretation can be problematic. Comprehensive health",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.973116874694824,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        606.2061767578125,
        526.6322021484375,
        619.3511962890625
      ],
      "text": "care worker training in test interpretation (including mandatory use of the reference reading",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.955459594726562,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        621.7061767578125,
        524.4288940429688,
        634.8511962890625
      ],
      "text": "card, where appropriate) is crucial to ensure accurate result interpretation for clinical action.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.974120140075684,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        637.2061767578125,
        78.81920623779297,
        650.3511962890625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        637.2061767578125,
        527.2136840820312,
        650.3511962890625
      ],
      "text": "The need for CD4 cell count results to select people for the test is problematic because these",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.974320411682129,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        652.7061767578125,
        526.6260986328125,
        665.8511962890625
      ],
      "text": "are not always immediately available. To facilitate implementation and benefit a wider range",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.948027610778809,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        668.2061767578125,
        527.0138549804688,
        681.3511962890625
      ],
      "text": "of individuals, eliminating the CD4 cell count as an eligibility criterion for people living with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        683.7061767578125,
        212.74850463867188,
        696.8511962890625
      ],
      "text": "HIV should be considered.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        699.2061767578125,
        78.81920623779297,
        712.3511962890625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        699.2061767578125,
        434.5040588378906,
        712.3511962890625
      ],
      "text": "In a hospital setting, bedside testing may violate patient confidentiality.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        714.7061767578125,
        78.81920623779297,
        727.8511962890625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        714.7061767578125,
        526.8861694335938,
        727.8511962890625
      ],
      "text": "Results must be captured in a standardized way that feeds into facility and NTP",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        730.2061767578125,
        174.7985076904297,
        743.3511962890625
      ],
      "text": "reporting systems.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        745.7061767578125,
        78.81920623779297,
        758.8511962890625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        745.7061767578125,
        527.013671875,
        758.8511962890625
      ],
      "text": "Quality assurance schemes need to be rolled out, and external quality controls need to be",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        761.2061767578125,
        453.5998840332031,
        774.3511962890625
      ],
      "text": "made available, to ensure tests and testing processes are quality controlled.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        353.2680969238281,
        802.0169067382812,
        554.5132446289062,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "2. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB disease 55",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}